<https://w3id.org/lmodel/dpv/DpvResource> dcterms:title "Resource" ;
	a linkml:ClassDefinition ;
	skos:exactMatch "rdfs:Resource"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/dpv/dpv_terms"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:note "DPV's domainIncludes and rangeIncludes say what a property usually joins, not what it must, so a validator cannot refuse a value on them. tests/dpv_rules.py reports a value that names nothing, and tests/test_examples.py lists where DPV's own examples leave those classes." ;
	linkml:class_uri "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/dpv/DpvResource"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	linkml:description "A thing a use case describes with DPV, such as a process, holding any DPV property, because DPV states none as limited to a class." ;
