	linkml:description "A LinkML model of the Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV) 2.3 of the W3C Data Privacy Vocabularies and Controls Community Group. DPV states each concept as a class and as an instance of a broader concept, so the model holds its terms as records: each concept that terms are instances of is a class, each property is a slot under its own IRI, and every term of DPV's vocabularies is a record that validates against them." ;
